},
{ 
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"No need to argue. Everyone has their own strengths.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Isabelle",
    "msg":"Are you really fighting right now? In this mess? We work together, or we don't make it out alive.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Elijah",
    "msg":"You're right...",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Elijah",
    "msg":"I'm Elijah, I'm an Innate.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"My name is Karl. As I mentioned, I'm an Innate as well.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Isabelle",
    "msg":"The name's Isabelle, I'm a Mage.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Andrea",
    "msg":"Fantastic. I'm surrounded by kids playing with sticks.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Isabelle",
    "msg":"Right... and you are?",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Andrea",
    "msg":"Andrea...",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"Alright, now that introductions are out of the way, we need to find someone from the Resistance.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"I believe the experiment wasn't particularly successful.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Andrea",
    "msg":"Impressive, coming from a brain soaked in magic.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
    "name":"Elijah",
    "msg":"Wait... what experiment?",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"Oh... I'm sorry, you were brought here against your will.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Elijah",
    "msg":"...",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Karl",
    "msg":"Something wrong, Elijah?",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Elijah",
    "msg":"My sister... we were together before this.",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_maschi
},
{
    "name":"Isabelle",
    "msg":"Maybe she...",
    "img":noone,
    "voice": Dialoghi_femmine
},
{
